      "content": "Those feelings of emptiness and feeling like a mistake are intensely painful, but they are symptoms of deep distress, not necessarily objective truths about your existence. Even when the familiar parts feel erased, the biological and inherent part of you—the one experiencing this pain—is still very real. Please consider that reaching out to a mental health professional can help you find an anchor point in the present moment to validate your feelings and find purpose outside of that deleted connection. You deserve care during this profound silence.",
